course: dictionary
lesson: 9714
title: Words with a place in them
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Some words are names of places, and they tell you where something comes from. Sumatran is one of them. It means from or to do with Sumatra, a large island of Indonesia in South-East Asia. «The Sumatran tiger lives only on the island of Sumatra.» The word Sumatran comes before tiger, so it tells you which tiger we mean.
explain: A word can also name a person. A Sumatran is a person from Sumatra. The adjective Sumatran describes a thing, such as a tiger or a rainforest, while the noun a Sumatran is a person. Both come from the same place name, so if you know Sumatra, you can guess the meaning.
explain: Use the context to check your guess. «Sumatran elephants are the smallest Asian elephants, and some help rangers patrol the forest.» The sentence tells you that Sumatran elephants are a kind of elephant, so Sumatran must describe where they come from.
fact: Sumatran means from or to do with Sumatra, an island of Indonesia.
fact: A Sumatran is a person from Sumatra. The plural is Sumatrans.
fact: Sumatran is used in the names of rare animals: the Sumatran tiger, the Sumatran orangutan, the Sumatran rhinoceros and the Sumatran elephant.
fact: «Sumatran tigers» are the smallest tigers and live only on Sumatra; fewer than about 600 are thought to be left in the wild.
fact: «The Sumatran rhino» has a hairy coat and is the only Asian rhino with two horns; fewer than about fifty are thought to survive.
exercise: «The Sumatran tiger lives only on the island of Sumatra.» What does Sumatran mean in this sentence? | *From or to do with Sumatra | A kind of food | A type of rainy weather | A large island in Europe
exercise: What do we call a person who comes from Sumatra? | A Sumatrian | An Indonesian tiger | A Sumatra person | *A Sumatran
exercise: «The Sumatran rhino is the only Asian rhino with two horns.» How many horns does it have? | Four | *Two | None | One
test: «Forests are cut down for farms, so Sumatran tigers lose their home.» Why are Sumatran tigers in danger? | *Their forest home is being cut down | They live in the sea | They are too big to find food | They are too happy
test: Which of these is a Sumatran animal? | A penguin | *Sumatran orangutan | A polar bear | A kangaroo
exam: Ella says Sumatran must be a kind of food. What does Sumatran really mean? | A type of drink | A kind of food | A type of rain | *From or to do with Sumatra, an island of Indonesia
